			"notes": "# Changelog\nNAI Additions has been rewrote and updated to 1.20.1\n### Technical Changes:\n\n- NAI Additions now supports both Fabric and Forge 1.20.1\n- NAI Additions now require [Architectury API](https://modrinth.com/mod/architectury-api)\n- For Fabric: Fabric Loader required version is 0.15.11 or higher\n- For Forge: Forge required version is 47.x.x or higher\n---\n### Changes:\n(Compared to v0.0.7 Alpha)\n- Reptianium Ore is now a little bit more rare\n\t- Now it spawns scattered from 0 to 2 blocks per chunk\n\t- It can spawn from Y-level 16 to Y-level -60\n- Added Reptianium Smithing Template\n\t- Used to craft Reptianium tools and armor from Netherite in a smithing Table\n\t- Can be found in Ancient Cities\n\t- Can be purchased from an Expert Toolsmith\n\t- Can be duplicated using a Reptianium Shard and 2 Netherite Ingots\n- Reptianium Armor is nerfed a little bit\n\t- Lowered Armor values\n\t\t- Helmet ( 12 -> 6 )\n\t\t- Chestplate ( 24 -> 18 )\n\t\t- Leggings ( 18 -> 14 )\n\t\t- Boots ( 10 -> 6 )\n\t- Toughness and Knockback Resistance stay the same\n- Virtus and Nefas Lamps got reworked on\n\t- Now instead of giving the player an effect that prevents mob spawning around the player, The lamps will prevent mob spawning around itself\n\t- Virtus Lamp prevents hostile mobs from spawning in a 64 x 64 x 64 block cube-shaped area\n\t- Nefas Lamp prevents passive mobs from spawning in a 64 x 64 x 64 block cube-shaped area\n\t- Virtus and Nefas lamps now emit particles showcasing the prevention area\n\t- Virtus and Nefas lamps are now crafted with Polished Deepslate instead of Polished Blackstone\n- Essences changes\n\t- Essences were Renamed\n\t\t- Essence of Allay -> Essence of Virtus\n\t\t- Essence of Vex -> Essence of Nefas\n\t- Essence of Virtus can no longer be got from Allays\n\t- Instead, They can be found in Woodland Mansions or Pillager Outposts\n\t- Essence of Nefas can be obtained from Vexes\n\t- Essence of Life can't be crafted anymore\n\t- Essence of Life can't be used in crafting spawn eggs anymore\n- Removed Geiger Finder Enchantment\n\t- Will be readded in a future update\n- Removed Advancements\n\t- Will be readded in a future update\n- Removed Spawn Eggs recipes\n- Removed Dolphin Head\n- Removed Bat Wing\n- Removed Music Discs\n- Removed Paintings\n- Removed test items\n---\n### Fixed Bugs:\n(Compared to v0.0.7 Alpha)\n- Reptianium Block, Virtus and Nefas Lamp now drop when broken in survival\n---\n\n### Known Issues:\n- Forge crashes on startup due to registering Trades before Items (Fixed in v0.1.1 Alpha)\n\n---\n### Notes:\n- NAI Additions version is `0.1.0-Alpha`\n- NAI Additions will be updated to newer versions of Minecraft once I feel happy with it or once it gets stable, In 1.20.2 and beyond, Forge will be replaced by NeoForge.\n- Reptianium armor isn't trimmable thanks to the way Mojang made trimmable armor, Reptianium armor will be trimmable in a future update\n- Particles chosen for Virtus and Nefas Lamps in this version are placeholders and will be changed in a future update\n---\nP.S.: I'm making this project for fun! And also to learn Java, It might not get updated or maintained frequently, But I will try to not abandon it."
